<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">The Company accounted for the operating
results of RPK which was a net loss of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c55" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProfitLossFromDiscontinuedOperations" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9798">461,405</ix:nonFraction> as a discontinued operation during the six months ended June 30, 2024 and has reclassified
the operating results of RPK as a discontinued operation for the six months ended June 30, 2023.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>




</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p><div>

</div><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 8; Value: 1 --><div>
