<td style="width: 0"/><td style="width: 0.25in"><b>10.</b></td><td style="text-align: justify"><b>Right-of-use Assets</b></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">On August 1, 2022, the Company entered
into a lease agreement for an office space with a monthly lease payment of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c176" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="akan:OperatingLeasesMonthlyLeasePayments" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9973">20,000</ix:nonFraction> over a period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c176" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="akan:OperatingLeasesLeaseTerm" id="ixv-9974">two years</ix:nonNumeric>. The right-of-use assets
recognized was measured at an amount equal to the recognized lease liabilities (note 13).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="akan_DisclosureOfMovementInRightOfUseAssetsTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="akan:DisclosureOfMovementInRightOfUseAssetsTableTextBlock" id="ixv-9975">The details of the right-of-use assets
recognized as at June 30, 2024 are as follows:</ix:nonNumeric></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

