<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">During the six months ended June 30,
2024, the Company recorded amortization on its right-of-use assets of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="akan:AmortizationRightOfUseAssets" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9983">102,051</ix:nonFraction>&#160;(2023 &#8211; $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c3" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="akan:AmortizationRightOfUseAssets" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9984">102,840</ix:nonFraction>).</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

