$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c292" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="akan:WarrantsParValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-10199">4.864</ix:nonFraction> per share for gross proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c292" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromExerciseOfWarrants" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-10200">5,000,000</ix:nonFraction>. The prefunded warrants are immediately exercisable for $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c292" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:WeightedAverageExercisePriceOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangementExercisedDuringPeriodAtDateOfExercise2019" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-10201">0.004</ix:nonFraction> per share&#160; and may
