as set forth in the prefunded warrant. <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c292" decimals="0" format="ixt:fixed-zero" name="ifrs-full:IncreaseDecreaseThroughExerciseOfWarrantsEquity" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-10202">No</ix:nonFraction> value has been allotted to the prefunded warrants under the residual method. During the six
months ended June 30, 2024, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c293" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="akan:NumberOfCommonSharesIssuedExerciseOnWarrants" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-10203">1,246,805</ix:nonFraction> common shares pursuant the exercise of&#160;above&#160;prefunded warrants.</td></tr></table>

