a loan of C$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c392" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:LoansReceived" scale="0" unitRef="nio" id="ixv-10349">24,000</ix:nonFraction> ($<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c392" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:LoansReceived" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-10350">17,714</ix:nonFraction>) from 1248787. The loan is unsecured, bears interest of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c392" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:BorrowingsInterestRate" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-10351">18</ix:nonFraction>% per annum and payable within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c393" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="akan:BorrowingsMaturityTerm" id="ixv-10352">12&#160;months</ix:nonNumeric>. As
