<td style="width: 35.45pt"/><td style="width: 14.2pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">ii.</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">On September&#160;27, 2023, the Company received
a loan of C$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c396" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:LoansReceived" scale="0" unitRef="nio" id="ixv-10355">3,000</ix:nonFraction> ($<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c396" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:LoansReceived" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-10356">2,219</ix:nonFraction>) from 1248787. The loan is unsecured, bears interest of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c396" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:BorrowingsInterestRate" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-10357">18</ix:nonFraction>% per annum and payable within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c397" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="akan:BorrowingsMaturityTerm" id="ixv-10358">12&#160;months</ix:nonNumeric>. As
