a loan of C$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c400" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:LoansReceived" scale="0" unitRef="nio" id="ixv-10361">40,000</ix:nonFraction> ($<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c400" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:LoansReceived" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-10362">29,258</ix:nonFraction>) from 1248787. The loan is unsecured, bears interest of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c400" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:BorrowingsInterestRate" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-10363">18</ix:nonFraction>% per annum and payable within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c401" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="akan:BorrowingsMaturityTerm" id="ixv-10364">12&#160;months</ix:nonNumeric>. As
